OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform politician likens
OL,4,Aparty's response to criticism to an
OL,5,Aabuser
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn ex-Reform UK politician has likened
OL,8,Fher former party's response to
OL,9,Fcriticism as being "like an abuser in a
OL,10,Fdomestic abuse relationship".
OL,12,FSarah Cooper-Lesadd, who defected to
OL,13,FPlaid Cymru last month, also said she
OL,14,Fwas "not surprised" by recent
OL,15,Fallegations of sexism and misogyny
OL,16,Fwithin the party, claiming she had
OL,17,Fpersonal experience of such behaviour.
OL,19,FReform UK says Cooper-Lesadd should
OL,20,Fresign and called her claims "outright
OL,21,Ffabrications".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
